{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02676",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 5.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Um, hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.47,
      "end_seconds": 10.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.03,
      "end_seconds": 17.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "mm, honestly, it's vomiting, and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.44,
      "end_seconds": 22.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.54,
      "end_seconds": 25.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Probably three weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.5,
      "end_seconds": 36.62,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.29,
      "end_seconds": 59.39,
      "duration_seconds": 21.1,
      "text": "So, it sort of comes and goes. A seven out of ten, I suppose. I've also had severe tummy pain out of proportion to the examination, since this morning. About severe tummy pain out of proportion to the examination, honestly, once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.04,
      "end_seconds": 64.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "let me check a few things any hernia or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.99,
      "end_seconds": 70.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I mean, no, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.89,
      "end_seconds": 75.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Have you had chest pain, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.72,
      "end_seconds": 80.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Not that that I've noticed, no chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.85,
      "end_seconds": 84.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.14,
      "end_seconds": 86.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.07,
      "end_seconds": 88.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.28,
      "end_seconds": 91.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No, um, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.51,
      "end_seconds": 96.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.76,
      "end_seconds": 103.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "I'm on a blood thinner, 5 milligrams, stopped last month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.49,
      "end_seconds": 105.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "ah tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.95,
      "end_seconds": 112.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.48,
      "end_seconds": 116.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.5,
      "end_seconds": 119.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.98,
      "end_seconds": 123.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.27,
      "end_seconds": 128.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.98,
      "end_seconds": 133.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.04,
      "end_seconds": 138.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.71,
      "end_seconds": 160.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.39,
      "end_seconds": 165.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "yes, erythromycin, it gives me bad stomach cramps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.22,
      "end_seconds": 171.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.18,
      "end_seconds": 186.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.8,
      "end_seconds": 203.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 114 beats a a minute, blood pressure 130 over 84, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.73,
      "end_seconds": 207.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Alright, shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.11,
      "end_seconds": 211.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.98,
      "end_seconds": 234.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "Your pulse is irregular, the tummy is soft but terribly painful, and the pain is out of proportion to what I find."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.52,
      "end_seconds": 243.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Right, that's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.21,
      "end_seconds": 264.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at possible bowel ischaemia or a bowel obstruction."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.59,
      "end_seconds": 267.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.89,
      "end_seconds": 278.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible bowel ischaemia, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.78,
      "end_seconds": 316.61,
      "duration_seconds": 20.83,
      "text": "An urgent CT angiogram is what I'd like next, for possible bowel ischaemia. I'm going to order urgent blood tests, for severe abdominal pain. This is an emergency, you are going to hospital now. I'd like to see you again straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.74,
      "end_seconds": 330.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "Sorry, you know, what was I saying, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.58,
      "end_seconds": 332.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "So, goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}